{"v":4,"catch":"在大腦從未伸展過的地方伸展你的大腦！","desc":"《CUE BRICK》是KONAMI於1989年發行的益智遊戲。\n目標是移動構成地面的磚塊，形成一條供所有球遵循的路徑。\n一旦你上癮了，就無法逃避這個遊戲。 共有 101 個驚心動魄的謎題等著你的大腦！\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2024-05-30","genres":["益智","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/afb5a3a5633dcffeab6c0bd062ed4bc3f125db7c43bb8acbc73d364d6771fac1.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e8ea1d744ca273a0beecbd3eb4d5c3e676d617db97feb28866a8219fd2187a1d.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4fc5c41203d87e927877c7046acd7f62f2e1e1a9a44feae30449155e3a7e3277.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ade8e2c3ad06a434f05030f5b06a459dce81c04d4a690c5db5444505f69d637e.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3dd2cd1ed52c25e6db0195c1f064e892bcc429a5f86bc5ef50c05369836cf9e9.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/545b09e4a1b4518b16ec4c8c9064fbb8f74e216841edbf4c0cad4247f1adc526.jpg"],"titleId":"010066001e178000","dlc":[]}